["ctl","avg1_135","b","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Done plenty of undercover work at big companies. I know how the game is played.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","003","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","If you want to pull something off in a massive company like this, you gotta find the blind spots in their protocol—the gray areas.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-80.0,null,1.05,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_103","e","002",0.8,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","e",null,null,0.75,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","005","attention",0.4,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Take you and Nyx today. Slacking off in the greenhouse, right? And nobody came after you for it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_103","e","011",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_103","Yeah. Nyx's excuse was \"going to the infirmary.\" We didn't go. Nobody asked.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","004","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Standard practice. The supervisor just needs a reason on paper for your absence. The infirmary checks the box. Anything else isn't their problem.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","011","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","As long as nothing blows back on them, they couldn't care less where an employee goes or what they're actually doing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_103","e","006",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_103","But what if someone checks with the infirmary staff? They'd find out we were never there!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","006",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Easy fix.==W== Make up another excuse. \"I felt better on the way,\" or \"I was in too much pain to walk there.\" You get the idea.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_412"],["ctl"